sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Engineer
    actor Lead
    participant Board as The board
    participant Panel as The blocked panel

    Engineer->>Lead: I intend to move PROJ-NNN to blocked because we need<br/>ACTOR to do ACTION before our team can work on this

    alt Lead agrees
        Lead-->>Engineer: Proceed
        Engineer->>Board: Status to Blocked, label to ready-for-human,<br/>comment naming the actor, the ask and the date
        Note over Board: Assignee unchanged —<br/>still the engineer who will build it
        Board->>Panel: The ticket shows in the blocked panel
        Panel->>Lead: This block is now the lead's to clear
    else The lead's questions show it is not blocked
        Lead-->>Engineer: Who exactly, and what have they been asked for?
        Note over Engineer,Panel: Nothing moves. The ticket stays where it is,<br/>and never reaches the blocked panel
    end
